.TH L10N-LINT 1 "February 2026" "l10n-lint 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
l10n-lint \- linter for localization files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B l10n-lint
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIPATH\fR...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B l10n-lint
checks gettext .po and Qt .ts localization files for common issues:
missing translations, fuzzy entries, placeholder mismatches, and length problems.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show version number and exit.
.TP
.BR \-g ", " \-\-github " " \fIREPO\fR
Lint a GitHub repository (owner/repo or URL).
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-path " " \fIPATH\fR
Path filter for GitHub repos.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-format " " \fIFORMAT\fR
Output format: text (default), json, github
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Show only summary line.
.TP
.BR \-\-check
Exit code only, no output (for CI).
.TP
.BR \-\-skip\-fuzzy
Ignore fuzzy warnings.
.TP
.BR \-\-strict
Treat warnings as errors.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-verbose
Show detailed progress.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Check all .po files in current directory:
.B l10n-lint .
.TP
Check specific file with JSON output:
.B l10n-lint \-\-format json messages.po
.TP
Lint a GitHub repository:
.B l10n-lint \-\-github owner/repo
.TP
CI mode (exit code only):
.B l10n-lint \-\-check .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
No issues found.
.TP
.B 1
Issues found or error occurred.
.SH AUTHOR
Daniel Nylander <daniel@danielnylander.se>
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tp-lint (1),
.BR po-translate (1),
.BR msgfmt (1)
